config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_OSDRV_SENSORS
	bool "sigmastar-osdrv-sensors"
	depends on BR2_SOC_VENDOR_SIGMASTAR
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  SigmaStar sensor driver kernel modules, built from source for the
	  configured Infinity family.

	  Produces one sensor_<model>_mipi.ko per supported sensor, plus
	  sensor_config.ko, which exposes the i2c probe over /dev/srcfg.
	  All are installed; load_sigmastar picks one at runtime from the
	  U-Boot `sensor` variable. Nothing loads sensor_config.ko now that
	  ipctool is gone -- it is what a native SigmaStar detector would
	  drive.

	  https://github.com/openipc/sensors
